			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 760020501,
					"content": "哈！終於解決了，滿口胡言亂語的外國佬，還什麼燙不燙的，被凍住就不燙了吧？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760020502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍伊卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 760020502,
					"content": "這…這樣一來應該就能阻止違禁品被運到那夏鎮了吧？哦對，不要忘記我們的酬勞哦！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760020503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760020503,
					"content": "哼，比起那個，還是先讓小爺我驗驗貨…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760020504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍伊卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 760020504,
					"content": "嗯？驗…貨？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760020505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760020505,
					"content": "#不然呢？要是出了問題，不但{F#妳}{M#你}們分不到摩拉，我的這些弟兄們也一分報酬都拿不到。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760020506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍伊卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 760020506,
					"content": "嘖…這些刮痕，甚至還有鏽跡！灰河現在真是敷衍透頂了…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760020507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍伊卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 760020507,
					"content": "咦，這不是楓丹的發條機關嗎？不過，這麼看看的話，楓丹的技術還真厲害啊，運到這裡還能動…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760020508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 760020508,
					"content": "動？這東西的能源系統應該早就被拆掉了，怎麼可能——",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760020509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "霍伊卡"
				},
				{
					"id": 760020509,
					"content": "「警告。啟動模式<color=#FF5E41FF>異常</color>。能源模組<color=#FF5E41FF>異x5F02&#5E38常</color>。驗證失敗。」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						760020510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「貝勒維爾小姐」"
				},
				{
					"id": 760020510,
					"content": "「驗證失敗。<color=#FF5E41FF>驗證失敗</color>。<color=#FF5E41FF>驗證失敗</color>。<color=#FF5E41FF>殲滅</color>。<color=#FF5E41FF>殲滅</color>。<color=#FF5E41FF>殲滅</color>。<color=#FF5E41FF>殲滅殲滅殲滅殲</color>——」",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
